{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53183","headline":"诗偈 八 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古时不异今，今时不异古。\n生事日日灭，有所不能作。\n世上乏钱财，守空无货赂。\n理诗日日新，朽宅时时故。\n闻船未破漏，爱河须早渡。\n出过三江口，逍遥神自悟。\n损之又损之，俄成贝多树。\n临行途路难，无船可相渡。\n业老见阎公，没你分疎处。\n若见优昙花，处处无疑虑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}